## Development Workflow

### Starting the Dev Server

```bash
cd estate-portal
npm install
npm run dev
# Open http://localhost:3000
```

### Database Migrations

```bash
# Create new migration
npx supabase migration new <migration_name>

# Push to Supabase
npx supabase db push

# Reset database (⚠️ destructive)
npx supabase db reset
```

### Testing

```bash
# E2E tests (Playwright)
npx playwright test

# Run specific test
npx playwright test tests/e2e/transaction.spec.ts
```

### Git Workflow

```bash
# Feature branch
git checkout -b feature/001-feature-name

# Commit (reference backlog feature ID)
git commit -m "[001] Implement feature XYZ"

# Push and create PR
git push origin feature/001-feature-name
gh pr create --title "[001] Feature Name"
```

