## GDPR Compliance (CRITICAL)

**⚠️ This project targets the EU market - GDPR compliance is mandatory**

**Current Status:**
- ✅ Strong authentication and authorization
- ✅ RLS policies limit data access
- ✅ Audit logging for admin actions
- ❌ **NO application-level encryption** (see Backlog Feature 001)
- ❌ **NO data export feature** (GDPR Article 20 violation)
- ❌ **NO account deletion** (GDPR Article 17 violation)

**Before enabling PII storage (NI numbers, passports, addresses):**
- ⚠️ **MUST implement Backlog Feature 001** (Sensitive PII Storage & GDPR Compliance)
- ⚠️ Legal review required
- ⚠️ Penetration testing required
- ⚠️ Data Processing Agreements with all third parties

**See:** [backlog/features/001-sensitive-pii-storage/README.md](backlog/features/001-sensitive-pii-storage/README.md)

