## Known Issues & Technical Debt

1. **LocalStorage session storage** - Vulnerable to XSS (consider httpOnly cookies)
2. **No rate limiting** - Add middleware for API routes
3. **No CSRF protection** - Validate Origin header on POST requests
4. **Service role key in .env** - Move to secure vault (Vercel env vars ok)
5. **Filenames may contain PII** - Implement hashing/anonymization
6. **No automated key rotation** - Set up 90-day rotation schedule

**See:** Technical debt can be added to backlog as P2/P3 features

